{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 35, "model_name": "mistralai/mistral-small-4-119b-2603", "content": "**A Most Wondrous Itinerary for a Journey to the Land of the Rising Sun**\n\n**Act I: Scene I**\n*In fair Tokyo’s bustling streets where neon lights do gleam*\n**Day 1:** Thou shalt alight at Narita’s gate and make thy way to thy lodging in Shinjuku’s heart. There rest and dine upon sushi fresh as morning’s dew.\n**Day 2:** To the Imperial Palace thou shalt repair and walk its grounds with reverence. In the afternoon seek Ueno Park where blossoms blush and poets pause. In the eve visit Akihabara’s wonders where gadgets gleam and otaku dwell.\n\n**Act II: Scene I**\n*Upon the Tokaido’s ancient path*\n**Day 3:** Take train to Kyoto (two hours swift as Cupid’s arrow). Check into a ryokan where tatami awaits and onsen’s warmth doth call.\n**Day 4:** To Kinkaku-ji thou shalt go the Golden Pavilion’s splendor to behold. At noon dine upon kaiseki’s art and in the eve walk Gion’s lantern-lit streets.\n**Day 5:** Fushimi Inari’s torii gates await thy steps at dawn. Then to Arashiyama where bamboo forests whisper and monkeys prance.\n\n**Act III: Scene I**\n*By sea and mountain’s breath*\n**Day 6:** Take train to Hiroshima (two hours’ flight) and visit the Peace Memorial’s solemn ground. Then to Miyajima where the torii stands in sea’s embrace.\n**Day 7:** Return to Kyoto and in the night take the last train to Osaka. Feast upon takoyaki and okonomiyaki where laughter rings and mirth abounds.\n\n**Act IV: Scene I**\n*Of Nara’s ancient grace*\n**Day 8:** Train to Nara where deer do bow and Todai-ji’s Buddha doth gaze. Then to Osaka’s castle where samurai once trod and now doth stand in grandeur.\n**Day 9:** In Osaka’s Dotonbori thou shalt eat and shop till thy feet do weary. In the eve take the Shinkansen to Kanazawa where geisha’s art doth thrive.\n\n**Act V: Scene I**\n*Of the snows of Hokkaido or the waves of Kyushu*\n**Day 10:** Choose thy path—either north to Sapporo’s snow or south to Fukuoka’s spice. Feast upon ramen rich or seafood fresh from the sea.\n**Day 11:** Return to Tokyo with treasures bought and memories made. In the eve dine at Tsukiji’s market where tuna’s glory gleams.\n\n**Epilogue**\n*Thus ends thy journey through Nippon’s fair and wondrous lands*\n**Day 12:** Take thy leave with heart full and soul enriched. May fortune smile upon thy travels and memories bright as cherry blossoms ever linger. Fare thee well gentle traveler!", "logprobs": [{"token": "**", "logprob": -0.7344911694526672}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.06829019635915756}, {"token": " Most", "logprob": -0.49230125546455383}, {"token": " W", "logprob": -0.4202532172203064}, {"token": "ond", "logprob": -1.0132738680113107e-05}, {"token": "rous", "logprob": -3.4570634852570947e-06}, {"token": " It", "logprob": -0.22782133519649506}, {"token": "iner", "logprob": -0.0005514293443411589}, {"token": "ary", "logprob": -0.005676222499459982}, {"token": " for", "logprob": -0.06301503628492355}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.08819786459207535}, {"token": " Journey", "logprob": -0.30594757199287415}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.05013072118163109}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.3989020586013794}, {"token": " Land", "logprob": -1.0229912996292114}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.00014840454969089478}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.003632496576756239}, {"token": " Rising", "logprob": -7.533743337262422e-05}, {"token": " Sun", "logprob": -0.00019572250312194228}, {"token": "**\n\n", "logprob": -0.0720108225941658}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.12827648222446442}, {"token": "Act", "logprob": -0.12489708513021469}, {"token": " I", "logprob": -0.16444942355155945}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.10672016441822052}, {"token": " Scene", "logprob": -0.42023566365242004}, {"token": " I", "logprob": -0.1525895595550537}, {"token": "**\n", "logprob": -2.730929136276245}, {"token": "*", "logprob": -0.5883125066757202}, {"token": "In", "logprob": -